00:45:42.150 --> 00:46:03.830
<v Benny>Actually, I did put a couple of them in the slide show. But then, when I was done, I never gave them back to his friend. I had them, like, stashed all over the place. I mean, at one point, they were in my Book of Mormon, they were in my Bible. I was just such a mess, just a boiling pot of crazy. I look back now, and I still don't even know who that person is, to behave like that.
<v Benny>其实，我确实在幻灯片里放了几张。但后来，当我做完后，我从来没有还给他的朋友。我把它们藏在各个地方。我的意思是，在某一点上，它们在我的摩门经里，它们在我的圣经里。我当时真是个一团糟，只是一个疯狂的沸腾锅。我回顾现在，我甚至不知道那个人是谁，竟然会有那种行为。

00:46:03.830 --> 00:46:07.560
<v Ira Glass>And what did you say to yourself at the time? What did you think it was?
