<v Benny>Oh, my gosh. I felt, once I was there in the chapel and this started happening, all of a sudden, this very dark cloud came over me of, boy, you are messing with fire, because now, you're in the Lord's house, and you are waiting for this boy that you are crushing just obsessively over. And I started to become very uncomfortable.
<v Benny>噢，天哪。一旦我到了礼拜堂，这开始发生，我突然感到非常黑暗的云层笼罩着我，伙计，你在玩火，因为现在，你在主的房子里，你在等待那个你痴迷于迷恋的男孩。我开始变得非常不舒服。

